{
"file": 58,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f203"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "f6d0b82f",
"en_raw": "Murase, I've got good news for you"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "bba49565",
"en_raw": "Really good news"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "dfb5763c",
"en_raw": "...Heh heh, I"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "48e2e9ea",
"en_raw": "did it"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "8aded5bc",
"en_raw": "I became a murderer"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "6410d335",
"en_raw": "Well, to be precise, in a little while"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "b580fe82",
"en_raw": "I'll become one"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "50da44e0",
"en_raw": "But I won't get caught"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "93ceec27",
"en_raw": "It's called an impossible crime"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "489ff632",
"en_raw": "this kind of murder"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9a9ce796",
"en_raw": "Segawa"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ed8c37de",
"en_raw": "lent me a hand"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f6af05d9",
"en_raw": "so it went super well"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "cb1778e0",
"en_raw": "You could do it easily too"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d33eed40",
"en_raw": "as long as you"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "9b6777fc",
"en_raw": "help with my work"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "fabe4970",
"en_raw": "...Heh heh, Angolmois"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "66b7a339",
"en_raw": "Quick, quick, the sacrifices, quickly"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "9cbbbd1e",
"en_raw": "Knock them all"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "4475d164",
"en_raw": "down to hell one by one"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "17f0701b",
"en_raw": "Kume..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ccb7dd92",
"en_raw": "What happened?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "88d7da12",
"en_raw": "...Heh heh"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "b31c20df",
"en_raw": "Yuasa's a pitiable guy too"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d19a05e3",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "addee7b4",
"en_raw": "Murase, I'll tell you now"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "88d4359e",
"en_raw": "I won't do anything that cruel"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "aea86ae8",
"en_raw": "with my own hands..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "81396b53",
"en_raw": "Heh heh, Murase"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "0ef8416c",
"en_raw": "In a little while"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "203c349a",
"en_raw": "something will happen to this class"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "5feb0971",
"en_raw": "Then you'll surely understand too"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "fa2ce179",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Murase?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b0b70074",
"en_raw": "At school, it's best not to"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "34a1126f",
"en_raw": "touch on this topic"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "72937ef6",
"en_raw": "except between you and me"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "be56c758",
"en_raw": "Tch, that Keina Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a322f3e6",
"en_raw": "blowing the story out of proportion..."
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "fd72852b",
"en_raw": "That woman blatantly"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "394fed73",
"en_raw": "suspects me"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "4d56d684",
"en_raw": "but she never says"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "948e7c21",
"en_raw": "a word about it..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "6543517a",
"en_raw": "Acting like a good person?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "95deaf92",
"en_raw": "No, it's those snide types"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "571c5275",
"en_raw": "who are the worst!"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "08bb9daa",
"en_raw": "...There's no way I'd do"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "9ac4663a",
"en_raw": "something that cruel"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "e1ea508c",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I have something to do..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "1df58ad3",
"en_raw": "See you."
}
]
}